lass=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体重循环</span><span class=\"tag\">减肥</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"美国联手日本干预日元：卖欧元而非美元，赌日本央行加息 美国财政部罕见联手日本干预日元，卖出欧元而非美元，并动用 FEMA 回购工具。Brad Setser 认为，只要日本央行加息，干预就能奏效，且日本财政状况远好于美国。 Odd Lots Odd Lots Brad Setser on the US&#x27;s Unusual Japanese Yen Intervention 日元 外汇干预 日本央行 美债 财政政策 FIMA Repo Facility ESF Primary Balance Carry Trade Big Mac Index\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-oddlots-美国为何联手日本干预日元-新工具与旧逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>美国联手日本干预日元：卖欧元而非美元，赌日本央行加息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国财政部罕见联手日本干预日元，卖出欧元而非美元，并动用 FEMA 回购工具。Brad Setser 认为，只要日本央行加息，干预就能奏效，且日本财政状况远好于美国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日元</span><span class=\"tag\">外汇干预</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"222纳米灯杀菌有效却一年只卖几百台，瓶颈不是技术 Far UVC 用 222 纳米光在空气中灭活病原体，对人体表层无害；南非 TB 试验已看到 90% 抑制，但全世界一年只卖几百台。真正瓶颈是认知扩散。 Complex Systems Complex Systems The economics of putting germicidal light in every room, with Misha Gurevich and Vivian Belenky of Aerolamp far UVC 空气传播疾病 公共卫生 创业 建筑规范 成本曲线 far UVC krypton chloride excimer lamp ASHRAE 241 R0 hygiene hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-complexsys-222纳米杀菌灯便宜有效-缺的是认知而非技术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fc764da6acb74e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=